What is an Oil Free Compressor?
Oil Free Compressors are sophisticated systems engineered to deliver 100% uncontaminated compressed air by preventing any oil from entering the compression chamber. Because they guarantee a complete absence of oil contamination, these compressors are essential for meeting the highest international air quality standards, most notably ISO 8573-1 Class Zero, which is critical for protecting sensitive products and processes.
